WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
systems. The whole reason I&#x27;m bringing

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.400
up this issue of of parental control, of

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.599
deconstruction, is this whole idea of

00:00:06.599 --> 00:00:09.000
allegiance. When you&#x27;re talking to

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.319
someone and it feels like a brick wall,

00:00:12.319 --> 00:00:15.680
that brick wall is the problem. I argue

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.919
allegiance and the building of trust is

00:00:17.919 --> 00:00:20.479
how that wall is built. It builds a sort

00:00:20.479 --> 00:00:23.120
of allergy to certain types of

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.360
information, certain tones. I&#x27;ve felt it

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.800
myself. Where does that allergy come

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.440
from? And where was it built? We have

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.440
social architects in this world building

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:36.319
these fantastical systems. We need to

00:00:36.319 --> 00:00:38.960
build tools which help us focus down on

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.840
this problem. Be careful what you pledge

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.599
allegiance to.

00:00:44.599 --> 00:00:47.599
Um because for God&#x27;s sake, mayday,

00:00:47.599 --> 00:00:48.000
mayday.
